    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinukwila nami nimúuki Isarela, kuluwa kwaEfweremi hiku-kumwekana, nikutama kwaSamariya nawa, muloŋa akoŋaŋa yakutwamba. Ikombi weŋilaŋa mukachi, chendu chawakwakubuwa chabuwilaŋa hanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyatoŋojokaŋa chachiwahi munyichima yawu nawu ami naanukaŋa kutama kwawu kwejimaku. Ichi dinu yuma yelaŋawu yinayijikilili niniku niniku, yidi kumesu ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amutiyishaŋa mwanta kuwaha nakutama kwawu, nakutwambatwamba kwatwambaŋawu atulamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wawu hiyayivumbi hohu, adi neyi ŋiku danatatishuwu kudi mukwakutuŋa mankendi; walekaŋa kukundakesha kesi, hela kukama wuŋa wanafuŋiyi, chiŋa wunayili dehi neluŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku damwanta wetu atulamba adisanzishili neyena davinyu; wolweli chikasa chindi hamu nawakwakudiwula akwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyichima yawu yekala nakesi kakukasakasa yuma yatama neyi ŋiku, kuzuwa kwawu kwakamaŋa wufuku wejima neyi kesi; habudidi hikakubutuka ninyizuzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wawu atata neyi ŋiku, avwotaŋa ansompeshi jawu; anyanta jawu ejima anadimbuki; mukachi kawu himudi wumu wantambikaŋaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi amufuŋila dehi hamu nanyuza yacheŋi, hidinkendi daha mutamba wumu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akwacheŋi anadyi Ŋovu jindi, yena kuchiluka nehi, mwalala wamena dehi invu niniku niniku, yena kuchiluka nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanta wadinkaŋawu aIsarela washimunaŋa wunsahu kumesu indi. Hela mwejimimu wena kubalumuka atala kudi Yehova Nzambi yawu, hela kumukeŋakeŋa, nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi wudi neyi katela kazenzalala, kabula muchima; atambikaŋa kuEjipitu, kuya hiyakuya kuAshuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakayawu nakatanjika wanda wami hadi wena; nakayiholola neyi tujila twahaluzwizu; nakayibabesha mwomwatiya dehi chipompelu chawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo akwetu! Ajimbela dehi kwakulehi nanami; ajilumuki kwawu! Anmotoka dehi ami. Wena anantwambili dehi, kutoŋa nakeŋeli kuyikúula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakalukaŋawu hatudidi twawu, hiyadililaŋa kudami nanyichima yawuku. Apompelaŋa kwatidiku navinyu hohu, adikaŋaŋa nanami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoŋa yami nayifumbili, yami nawa nakolesheli makasawu, hela chochu, anfuukwilaŋa yatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufunta afuntaŋa, ilaŋa hiyafuntaŋa kudi wekala mwiwuluku; adi neyi wuta wamukunji waluwa. Atulamba twawu akadimbuka kumpoku yakabali muloŋa wakuzuwa kwamadimi awu kwasweja, dichichuma chakayisehelawu mwitaŋa daEjipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
